 signed number which  can go as high as 2 to the power of 31  minus 1  which is the number that size video  exceeded  they've now implemented a 64-bit signed  system for that the number of views  which means the videos can go as high as  2 to the power 63 minus 1 which is 9  quintillion 223 quadrillion 372 trillion  36 billion 854 million 775  807  if you look closely they forgot to  subtract the one  i hope you like this video please  subscribe to my channel  you can support me on patreon to get  exclusive rewards catch me on my blog  mindyourdecisions on twitter at  preshtalwalker and you can get my books  listed on my website
 

